  "data": "Ziyarah of Imam Hasan (a.s.)\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ رَسُوْلِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA RASOOLE RABBIL A’ALAMEENA \nPeace be on you, O son of the Messenger of the Lord of the Worlds!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA AMEERIL MOMENEENA \nPeace be on you, O son of the Commander of the Believers!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ فَاطِمَةَ الزَّهْرَآءِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA FAATEMATAZ ZAHRAAE \nPeace be on you, O son of Fatimah, the luminous lady! \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حَبِيْبَ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HABEEBAL LAAHE \nPeace be on you, O beloved of Allah!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صِفْوَةَ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SIFWATAL LAAHE \nPeace be on you, O choice of Allah!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اَمِيْنَ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA AMEENAL LAAHE \nPeace be on you, O trustee of Allah!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HUJJATAL LAAHE \nPeace be on you, O Argument of Allah!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نُوْرَ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA NOORAL LAAHE \nPeace be on you, O Light of Allah!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صِرَاطَ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SERAATAL LAAHE \nPeace be on you, O Path of Allah!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بَيَانَ حُكْمِ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA BAYAANA HUKMIL LAAHE\nPeace be on you, O elucidation of the rule of Allah!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نَاصِرَ دِيْنِ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA NAASERA DEENIL LAAHE \nPeace be on you, O supporter of the religion of Allah!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا السَّيِّدُ الزَّكِیُّ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAS SAYYEDUZ ZAKIYYO \nPeace be on you, O pure master!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْبَرُّ الْوَفِیُّ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL BARRUL WAFIYYO \nPeace be on you, O self-righteous and truthful!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْقَآئِمُ الْاَمِيْنُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL QAAAEMUL AMEENO \nPeace be on you, O practiser (of God’s commands) and trustee!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْعَالِمُ بِالتَّاوِيْلِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL A’ALEMO BIT TAAWEELE \nPeace be on you, O well-experienced in the interpretation (of the Qur'an)!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْهَادِی الْمَهْدِیُّ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL HAADIL MAHDIYYO \nPeace be on you, O guide and well-guided!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الطَّاهِرُ الزَّكِیُّ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAT TAAHERUZ ZAKIYYO \nPeace be on you, O immaculate and pure!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا التَّقِیُّ النَّقِیُّ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAT TAQIYYUN NAQIYYO \nPeace be on you, O pious and infallible!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْحَقُّ الْحَقِيْقُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL HAQQUL HAQEEQ \nPeace be on you, O veritable truth!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الشَّهِيْدُ الصِّدِّيْقُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHASH SHAHEEDUS SIDDEEQO \nPeace be on you, O martyr and veracious!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اَبَا مُحَمَّدٍ ۨ الْحَسَنَ بْنَ عَلِیٍّ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAA MOHAMMADENIL HASANABNA A’LIYYIN\nPeace be on you, O Abu-Muhammad al-Hasan, the son of Ali!\nوَ رَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ.\nWA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nAllah’s mercy and blessings be upon you!",
