    "Ziyarah of Imam Husain (a.s.)\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ رَسُوْلِ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA RASOOLIL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O son of Allah’s Messenger!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA AMEERIL MOMENEENA \nPeace be upon you, O son of the Commander of the Believers!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ سَيِّدَةِ نِسَآءِ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA SAYYEDATE NESAAAIL A’ALAMEENA \nPeace be upon you, O son of the doyenne of the women of the world!\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ قَدْ اَقَمْتَ الصَّلوٰةَ\nASH-HADO ANNAKA QAD AQAMTAS SALAATA \nI bear witness that you performed the prayers [duly],\nوَ اٰتَيْتَ الزَّكٰوةَ\nWA AATAYTAZ ZAKAATA\ndefrayed the poor-rate,\nوَ اَمَرْتَ بِالْمَعْرُوْفِ\nWA AMARTA BIL MA’ROOFE \nenjoined the right,\nوَ نَهَيْتَ عَنِ الْمُنْكَرِ\nWA NAHAYTA A’NIL MUNKARE\nforbade the wrong,\nوَ عَبَدْتَ اللهَ مُخْلِصًا\nWA A’BADTAL LAAHA MUKHLESAN\nworshipped Allah sincerely,\nوَ جَاهَدْتَ فِی اللهِ حَقَّ جِهَادِهٖ\nWA JAAHADTA FIL LAAHE HAQQA JEHAADEHI\nand strove for the sake of Allah with due striving\nحَتّٰی اَتٰيكَ الْيَقِيْنُ\nHATTAA ATAAKAL YAQEENO\nuntil death came upon you.\nفَعَلَيْكَ السَّلَامُ مِنِّیْ\nFA-A’LAYKAS SALAAMO MINNEE \nSo, peace from me be upon you\nمَا بَقِيْتُ وَ بَقِیَ اللَّيْلُ وَالنَّهَارُ\nMAA BAQEETO WA BAQEYAL LAYLO WAN NAHAARO \nas long as I am alive and as long as day and night remain,\nوَ عَلٰی اٰلِ بَيْتِكَ الطَّيِّبِيْنَ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ\nWA A’LAA AALE BAYTEKAT TAYYEBEENAT TAAHEREENA \nand peace be upon your Household, the pure, the immaculate.\nاَنَا يَا مَوْلَایَ مَوْلًی لَكَ وَ لِآلِ بَيْتِكَ\nANAA YAA MAWLAAYA MAWLAN LAKA WA LE-AALE BAYTEKA \nO my master, I am a servant of you and of your Household,\nسِلْمٌ لِمَنْ سَالَمَكُمْ\nSILMUN LEMAN SAALAMAKUM \npeaceful with those who keep peace with you,\nوَ حَرْبٌ لِمَنْ حَارَبَكُمْ\nWA HARBUN LEMAN HAARABAKUM \nat war against those who are at war against you,\nمُؤْمِنٌ بِسِرِّكُمْ وَ جَهْرِكُمْ\nMOMENUN BE-SIRREKUM WA JAHREKUM\nand believing in your secret and open affairs\nوَ ظَاهِرِكُمْ وَ بَاطِنِكُمْ\nWA ZAAHEREKUM WA BAATENEKUM \nand your inward and outward affairs.\nلَعَنَ اللهُ اَعْدَآئَكُمْ\nLA’NAL LAAHO AA’DAAAKUM\nMay Allah curse your enemies\nمِنَ الْاَوَّلِيْنَ وَ الْاٰخِرِيْنَ\nMENAL AWWALEENA WAL AAKHEREEN \nfrom the past and late generations.\nوَ اَنَا اَبْرَءُ اِلَی اللهِ تَعَالٰی مِنْهُمْ\nWA ANAA ABRAO ELAL LAAHE TA-A’ALAA MINHUM \nAnd I release myself from them before Almighty Allah!\nيَا مَوْلَایَ يَا اَبَا مُحَمَّدٍ\nYAA MAWLAAYA YAA ABAA MOHAMMAD \nO my master, O Abu Muhammad;\nيَا مَوْلاَیَ يَا اَبَا عَبْدِ اللهِ\nYAA MAWLAAYA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE\nand my master, O Abu Abdullah!\nهٰذَا يَوْمُ الْاِثْنَيْنِ\nHAAZAA YAWMUL ISNAYNE \nToday is Monday,\nوَ هُوَ يَوْمُكُمَا وَ بِاسْمِكُمَا\nWA HOWA YAWMOKOMAA WA BISMEKOMAA\nwhich is the day of both of you and carrying your names.\nوَ اَنَا فِيْهِ ضَيْفُكُمَا\nWA ANAA FEEHE ZAYFOKOMAA \nOn this day, I am your guest;\nفَاَضِيْفَانِیْ وَ اَحْسِنَا ضِيَافَتِیْ\nFA-AZEEFAANEE WA AHSENAA ZEYAAFATEE\ntherefore, receive me as your guest and treat me hospitably.\nفَنِعْمَ مَنِ اسْتُضِيْفَ بِهٖ اَنْتُمَا\nFA-NE’MA MANIS TEZEEFA BEHI ANTOMAA\nVerily, you both are the most excellent hosts a guest may gain.\nوَ اَنَا فِيْهِ مِنْ جِوَارِكُمَا فَاَجِيْرَانِیْ\nWA ANAA FEEHE MIN JEWAAREKOMAA FA-AJEERAANEE\nOn this day too, I am in your vicinity; so, treat me as your neighbour,\nفَاِنَّكُمَا مَاْمُوْرَانِ بِالضِّيَافَةِ وَ الْاِجَارَةِ\nFA-INNAKOMAA MAAMOORAANE BIZ-ZEYAAFATE WAL EJAARATE \nsince you are commanded to receive your guests and neighbours hospitably.\nفَصَلَّی اللهُ عَلَيْكُمَا وَ آلِكُمَا الطَّيِّبِيْنَ.\nFASALLAL LAAHO A’LAYKOMAA WA AALEKOMAT TAYYEBEENA.\nMay Allah’s peace be upon you both and upon your immaculate household."
